  "releaseNotes": "3.0.0\n* Enhance README feature descriptions by @stephanstapel in https://github.com/stephanstapel/BrickOwlSharp/pull/12\n* Add per-method apiKey parameter and multi-store support by @norberto5 in https://github.com/stephanstapel/BrickOwlSharp/pull/16\n* Add ShipCollectionPoint property to OrderDetails by @norberto5 in https://github.com/stephanstapel/BrickOwlSharp/pull/15\n* Add update_time parameter to GetOrdersAsync by @norberto5 in https://github.com/stephanstapel/BrickOwlSharp/pull/17\n* Fix for_sale field dropped from UpdateInventory POST body by @norberto5 in https://github.com/stephanstapel/BrickOwlSharp/pull/18\n* Fix: UpdateInventory.ExternalId and UpdateExternalId should be string, not int by @norberto5 in https://github.com/stephanstapel/BrickOwlSharp/pull/20",
